OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court over death of
OL,4,Apedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared at Lisburn
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court charged with causing
OL,8,Fdeath by careless driving after the
OL,9,Fdeath of a woman on Friday.
OL,11,FMark Branagan, 34, and with an address
OL,12,Fat Muskett Road in Carryduff, was also
OL,13,Fcharged with driving without a licence,
OL,14,Fdriving without insurance and being an
OL,15,Funaccompanied learner driver.
OL,17,FThe victim, a pedestrian, was Pauline
OL,18,FDowning who was in her 60s.
OL,20,FShe was hit by a car on Friday
OL,21,Fafternoon in Aghagallon, County Antrim.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
